vibe-docker builds a container image that installs and runs third-party
software which is downloaded at build or run time and remains under its own
license. Notable components include Mistral AI's Mistral Vibe (Apache-2.0) and
the CLIs gh, glab, aws-cli, az, openspec, uv, pnpm, tfenv, and git-lfs. This
project is not affiliated with or endorsed by Mistral AI.
